WEBVTT

00:01.300 --> 00:03.770
Where would you like to go?

00:05.980 --> 00:08.040
<i>Are you sure I can pick?</i>

00:10.690 --> 00:13.540
<i>On my first date with Itsuomi-san,</i>

00:14.470 --> 00:18.190
<i>the place I want us to go together is...</i>

00:19.690 --> 00:22.750
How about using this? A curry festival special.

00:25.340 --> 00:29.020
Doesn't feel right, huh? What else?

00:29.020 --> 00:32.510
<i>Where should I take Itsuomi-san on our date?</i>

00:33.070 --> 00:37.210
<i>He's traveled the world. 
How can I make it fun for him?</i>

00:37.760 --> 00:41.890
Rin-chan, where do you and
Kyouya-san go on your dates?

00:39.540 --> 00:41.890
What? "Our dates"?!

00:42.430 --> 00:46.480
The only date we've been on is to the zoo.
I showed you that pic last time.

00:46.480 --> 00:48.400
The rest's been, like, drives and stuff?

00:49.320 --> 00:51.530
Don't fret so much over it.

00:51.530 --> 00:54.790
I'm sure Itsuomi-san can find ways 
to enjoy himself wherever you go.

00:55.790 --> 00:58.660
He probably wants to see <i>you</i> have a good time.

01:01.570 --> 01:02.660
<i>Me?</i>

01:03.640 --> 01:07.190
<i>Well, there </i>is<i> somewhere 
I want to go with him...</i>

02:34.170 --> 02:38.010
Our World

02:44.080 --> 02:46.920
<i>The next station is Seyama.</i>

02:46.920 --> 02:48.420
Train sure is empty today.

02:47.560 --> 02:49.510
<i>The doors on the right side will open.</i>

02:50.070 --> 02:52.520
<i>The next station is Seyama.</i>

02:52.520 --> 02:54.920
<i>The doors on the right side will open.</i>

