03:11.000 --> 03:14.830
<i>We just happened to take 
the same train that day,</i>

03:14.830 --> 03:19.510
<i>but today, we're here together 
and going to the same destination.</i>

03:26.520 --> 03:27.770
Here?

03:28.540 --> 03:30.550
