03:55.560 --> 03:59.670
Are we here today to take photos?

04:25.410 --> 04:27.420
Whoa, nice wisteria!

04:29.630 --> 04:31.450
<i>The scent is intense.</i>

04:31.450 --> 04:32.490
Sure is.

05:03.700 --> 05:10.590
<i>It just hit me what people mean when they 
say something "took their breath away."</i>

05:12.010 --> 05:13.490
By the way, Yuki,

05:13.490 --> 05:15.710
you were taking pics 
of the flowers again, right?

05:16.540 --> 05:19.650
<i>I like scenery and food pics,</i>

05:18.920 --> 05:23.300
I like scenery and food pics,

05:19.650 --> 05:22.150
<i>but I love taking photos 
of flowers most of all.</i>

05:22.170 --> 05:23.300
but I love taking photos
of flowers most of all.

05:26.050 --> 05:29.680
<i>This is the season where azalea 
adorn the ground</i>

05:30.110 --> 05:32.810
<i>and wisteria climb down from the skies.</i>

05:33.560 --> 05:38.270
<i>Before long, hydrangea 
will soak up the rain and bloom,</i>

05:39.240 --> 05:43.640
<i>and sunflowers will finally 
have their moment in the sun.</i>

05:44.030 --> 05:50.530
...and sunflowers will finally
have their moment in the sun.

I find it adorable

how all these flowers wait their
turn for their season to arrive.

05:44.550 --> 05:49.380
<i>I find it adorable how all these flowers 
wait their turn for their season to arrive.</i>

05:58.350 --> 06:02.990
There are bees all over the place. 
I shooed one away, though.

06:05.770 --> 06:08.650
So this is the world as you see it.

06:11.800 --> 06:13.810
Gimme your phone.

06:18.440 --> 06:21.080
How do I get the wisteria in the shot?

06:22.440 --> 06:24.100
<i>We're taking a pic together...</i>

06:26.750 --> 06:28.460
We need to talk about the timing.

06:29.830 --> 06:32.670
Let's go on three, two, one.

06:36.410 --> 06:37.060
Three.

06:37.060 --> 06:37.930
<i>Three.</i>

06:37.930 --> 06:38.420
Two.

06:38.420 --> 06:39.340
<i>Two.</i>

06:39.340 --> 06:40.220
One.

06:39.340 --> 06:40.220
<i>One.</i>

06:46.610 --> 06:48.760
Wow, that looks great.

06:52.250 --> 06:54.270
Yeah, and it tastes just as good.

06:58.120 --> 07:01.930
Fried chicken is great. Makes me want a beer.

07:04.150 --> 07:08.900
That reminds me.
You went drinking
with Oushi-kun?

07:06.070 --> 07:08.900
Oh, Oushi? How's he doing?

07:09.310 --> 07:13.040
Surprised you, huh? We're thick as thieves now.

07:13.040 --> 07:14.480
<i>Really?!</i>

07:14.480 --> 07:18.850
<i>I'm dead sure Itsuomi-san just said so 
and Oushi-kun's having to deal with it.</i>

07:19.660 --> 07:21.890
I wanna hang out at his place sometime.

07:22.440 --> 07:23.900
Take me there, Yuki.

07:24.310 --> 07:25.150
<i>His place?</i>

07:26.750 --> 07:29.130
Why'd you bring this ass here?!

07:31.480 --> 07:34.300
<i>That may be asking a bit too much.</i>

07:37.020 --> 07:40.060
Oh, was that sign for "impossible"?

07:40.940 --> 07:43.890
I thought you were giving me 
the signal to kiss you.

07:46.210 --> 07:48.280
That would've been random as heck, yeah.

07:48.860 --> 07:51.820
<i>Kiss? Out here?</i>

08:16.340 --> 08:18.450
Never mind. This really is too random.

08:20.870 --> 08:23.270
<i>We nearly kissed...</i>

08:24.280 --> 08:25.670
<i>Oh, wait.</i>

08:26.860 --> 08:29.860
<i>This means "no" in sign.</i>

08:29.860 --> 08:30.690
Oh, wow.

08:31.190 --> 08:32.670
<i>This means "okay,"</i>

08:33.180 --> 08:34.880
<i>and this means "no."</i>

08:34.880 --> 08:37.290
So it's like telling a hitter 
"you're outta here" in baseball.

08:42.610 --> 08:49.110
<i>Kissing here is too PDA, 
but I do want to cuddle.</i>

08:50.340 --> 08:52.050
<i>Do you mind?</i>

09:04.410 --> 09:06.910
It's like what you said before.

09:06.910 --> 09:09.490
If it's you,

09:11.210 --> 09:14.130
I'm okay with everything.

09:15.530 --> 09:16.930
