09:19.070 --> 09:23.080
I asked you once before...

09:21.080 --> 09:23.080
Why do you travel overseas
so often?

09:23.460 --> 09:24.670
Oh, that?

09:25.080 --> 09:26.990
I'll tell you if you want to know.

09:26.990 --> 09:28.600
<i>Huh? Really?</i>

09:29.130 --> 09:31.170
It's a long story, so let me type it out.

09:36.850 --> 09:42.730
<i>The frequent pauses in his fast typing 
show that he's thinking it through.</i>

09:45.350 --> 09:46.350
<i>There it is.</i>

09:46.350 --> 09:49.860
I asked you once before...
Why do you travel overseas so often?

09:46.350 --> 09:49.860
When I was little, I loved vehicles,
especially planes.
I used to have my folks take me
to the airport just so I could see...

09:47.510 --> 09:49.390
<i>Wow, it really is long.</i>

09:50.170 --> 09:51.570
Hup.

09:53.380 --> 09:56.610
We don't have much time today, 
so read it when you get home.

09:57.010 --> 09:58.150
<i>Oh...</i>

09:58.650 --> 10:01.320
