about what's in that text.

10:10.820 --> 10:12.010
Don't let it get to you.

10:12.730 --> 10:16.210
<i>That just makes me want to know even more.</i>

10:17.150 --> 10:20.840
<i>I guess he's trying to reassure me in advance.</i>

10:33.570 --> 10:34.410
You take a pic?

10:34.840 --> 10:36.030
<i>My apologies.</i>

10:40.700 --> 10:42.190
<i>Itsuomi-san...</i>

10:43.780 --> 10:48.430
<i>It made me so very happy 
when he said he was okay with everything.</i>

10:53.020 --> 10:57.110
<i>Every time I think back to it, 
I can feel my emotions going out of control.</i>

11:02.450 --> 11:05.260
<i>The swan boat ride was pretty rocky,</i>

11:05.260 --> 11:07.980
<i>which shook up my feelings even more.</i>

11:09.060 --> 11:13.250
<i>I had to make a show out of having fun 
just to hide the tears in my eyes.</i>

11:18.620 --> 11:22.320
Why do Saturday classes make you so drowsy?

11:22.320 --> 11:23.340
Right?

11:23.340 --> 11:25.960
Time much better spent 
having fun somewhere, huh, Oushi?

11:25.960 --> 11:27.640
It's so nice out, too.

11:27.640 --> 11:28.540
Yeah.

11:30.350 --> 11:31.630
Oushi.

11:32.640 --> 11:35.250
Who do you like more? Me or Mitoki?

11:35.550 --> 11:36.430
Wha?

11:36.430 --> 11:37.930
What's with the look?

11:37.930 --> 11:41.780
You're the one who was all, "I wanna wear 
my heart on my sleeve" the other day.

11:41.780 --> 11:45.290
And I'm trying to help free you 
from your shackles here.

11:45.290 --> 11:47.140
Couldn't you think of a better way?

11:47.140 --> 11:50.810
