12:16.790 --> 12:19.010
Ashioki's actually being open!

12:19.010 --> 12:23.200
Who is it? Wait, is it the girl 
with the hearing aids?

12:23.200 --> 12:24.540
Wha... No, it's not!

12:24.540 --> 12:26.460
Spill the tea, Batayan.

12:26.460 --> 12:27.290
Right away, sir.

12:26.800 --> 12:29.560
