12:52.140 --> 12:54.920
You and Shin-kun were in the same boat.

12:54.920 --> 12:55.700
Huh?

12:55.700 --> 12:59.840
You've both spent years 
pining for someone, right?

13:01.450 --> 13:04.590
But forget the rear-view mirror. 
What matters is what lies ahead.

13:05.250 --> 13:07.460
Are you sure you wanna 
be taking your time here?

13:10.840 --> 13:13.350
