13:20.740 --> 13:21.570
Uh...

13:22.010 --> 13:22.610
Hmm?

13:23.180 --> 13:25.860
What, something happen between you two?

13:26.130 --> 13:26.960
What?

13:26.960 --> 13:29.180
I don't know what's going on,

13:29.180 --> 13:32.360
but I hope she drops by again sometime soon.

13:32.870 --> 13:34.140
Me too.

13:39.100 --> 13:41.880
<i>Those four hours flew by.</i>

13:42.600 --> 13:44.950
<i>This train's really packed.</i>

13:54.280 --> 13:56.100
Oh, I'm sorry...

14:02.640 --> 14:05.390
Wow, isn't that guy super hot?

14:05.390 --> 14:08.280
Totally! Such a hunk!

14:06.680 --> 14:08.280
<i>I see hearts in their eyes.</i>

