about buying that book.

21:49.760 --> 21:51.410
Why not go for it today?

21:51.810 --> 21:53.620
I guess I could.

21:57.250 --> 21:59.470
Good luck, Oushi.

22:08.060 --> 22:09.180
Shin-chan...

22:12.370 --> 22:16.170
I thought pigs would fly 
before you ever asked me on a date.

22:16.170 --> 22:18.060
Yeah, well, they didn't.

22:27.010 --> 22:30.480
It's so pretty! Thank you, Kyouya-san!

22:30.480 --> 22:33.450
I'm glad you like it so much.

22:34.770 --> 22:38.990
I still can't believe we're actually dating.

22:39.430 --> 22:40.710
Neither can I.

22:41.170 --> 22:44.250
But we are, and I'm looking forward 
to the good times, Rin-chan.

22:44.250 --> 22:45.210
Me too!

22:47.720 --> 22:50.220
<i>I did it! I got my passport!</i>

23:03.890 --> 23:07.070
We can go anywhere in the world together now.

23:09.330 --> 23:11.950
Where should we go? I can't wait.

23:12.330 --> 23:16.200
<i>The world continues to grow larger 
and take on more color...</i>

23:17.480 --> 23:20.330
<i>And it won't ever stop.</i>
